  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO OPERATIONAL RESPONSE PLAN IN THE PALESTINE OCCUPIED TERRITORY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As of November 23rd, the WHO has recorded 14,845 fatalities, 36,000 injuries, 2,700 people trapped (or deceased) under rubble, and over 1,7million people displaced. The health system is experiencing acute shortages of fuel, water, medicines and medical supplies, while disease surveillance systems are struggling to operate. To date 181 attacks on health care facilities or workers have been recorded. 72% of hospitals and 65% of primary healthcare facilities are non-functional.</narrative>
  </description>
